name: handoff
description: Write an end-of-session handoff so the next session (fresh context, possibly another model) can resume without the conversation. Derived from the repo (git log, specs, spikes, checklists, reviews), not memory. Use when the user says handoff, wrap up, end of session, pausing, or before a context reset with work in flight.
